          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: 2004. Observations of the slow movement of a very bright point amidst a cluster of stars: observation of a rare configuration (every eight years) of the planet Venus amidst the Pleiades star cluster.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "9ce00ddc64ecb210e86e8d83d29d5c94344d2bba989fcba6a4f17182b12daaf8"
